      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.40 (vs ₹8.26 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.40 (down from ₹8.26 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.99b (up 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹430.8m (down 22% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 21% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 27% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 15% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
