      "body": "Jagsonpal Pharmaceuticals Limited (NSEI:JAGSNPHARM) announces a share repurchase program. Under the offer, the company will repurchase up to 1,600,000 shares, representing 2.39% of its issued share capital for INR 400 million. The shares will be repurchased at INR 250 per share. The offer is subject to approval from shareholders through postal ballot. As of March 12, 2026, the company had 66,962,250 outstanding shares.",
