      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.67 (down from ₹4.74 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹729.5m (down 1.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹109.5m (down 66% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (down from 43% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 32% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
